"[Technical interventions](../interventions/index.md) — the **Interventions**"
" button of the room lists its repair tickets."
msgstr ""
"[Interventions techniques](../interventions/index.md) — le bouton "
"**Interventions** de la chambre liste ses tickets de réparation."

